---
// 01 / Philosophy Section
---

<section class="border-b border-border bg-background">
  <div class="px-6 py-20 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <div class="micro-label text-muted-foreground mb-10">01 / Philosophy ——— Established 2026</div>
      <h2 class="font-display font-normal tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-[clamp(32px,4.6vw,64px)] text-foreground">
        We design slow garments for people who finish their rooms.
      </h2>
      <div class="hairline w-12 mx-auto my-10"></div>
      <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-foreground leading-[1.7] max-w-2xl mx-auto text-justify [text-justify:inter-character]">
        Afetto is a small house. We release one library each year and revisit a single archive volume each season. Every
        pattern is drafted by hand in a single-room studio in Porto, then sent to four ateliers across Portugal, Italy,
        England, and Japan. We choose mills the way other houses choose models. We do not chase silhouettes — we resolve
        them. The result is clothing that arrives quietly, holds its volume, ages without apology, and asks nothing of the
        wearer beyond use.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 mt-16 border border-border">
        <div class="p-5 flex flex-col items-center gap-1 border-r border-border">
          <span class="mono-label text-muted-foreground">01</span>
          <span class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight">Porto</span>
          <span class="mono-label text-muted-foreground">Origin</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 flex flex-col items-center gap-1 border-r border-border">
          <span class="mono-label text-muted-foreground">02</span>
          <span class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight">01</span>
          <span class="mono-label text-muted-foreground">Volumes / year</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 flex flex-col items-center gap-1">
          <span class="mono-label text-muted-foreground">03</span>
          <span class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight">04</span>
          <span class="mono-label text-muted-foreground">Ateliers</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
